# 創刻のアテリアル: save on SC0000's fourth page, read on, and load the save back. Unchanged on both targets, on a
# fresh sandbox (the default). It is the scenario of the game's save gate (docs/adding-a-game.md, step 7): native AGE
# and the port both pass it since 2026-11-19, and the save each writes loads on the other.
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native|port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native|port run tools/drive/scenarios/arterial-save-load.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native|port stop
# The save is SAVE00.DAT in the sandbox's SAVE folder. Compare two targets' files with
#   Ome.Cli save-diff A/SAVE00.DAT B/SAVE00.DAT --game arterial
# which shows the time stamp, the play seconds and three graphics start stamps and nothing else. Seed a new sandbox
# from the other target's (--seed native:fresh or port:fresh, after that target has stopped, since the shared
# SAVE.DAT is written when the game closes) to load one target's save on the other.

rand-seed 13
wait 5
click adv.next                          # skips the logo
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=90
wait 6
click title.start
wait-state top=SC0000@0xfff timeout=90  # page 1
settle timeout=20
advance 3
expect top=SC0000@0x12cf                # page 4
shot arterial-save-page4

rclick adv.next                         # the character menu
wait-state script=FELLOW timeout=20
wait 1.5
click menu.save
wait-state script=SAVE timeout=20
wait 1.5
click slot.0
wait 2
click confirm.yes
wait-state script=FELLOW timeout=20     # the save returns to the menu
wait 1.5
click menu.close
wait-state top=SC0000@0x12cf timeout=20
settle timeout=20

advance 2
rclick adv.next
wait-state script=FELLOW timeout=20
wait 1.5
click menu.load
wait-state script=SAVE timeout=20
wait 1.5
click slot.0
wait 2
click confirm.yes
wait-state top=SC0000@0x12cf timeout=60 # the load resumes page 4
settle timeout=20
shot arterial-save-loaded
